pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# livery-paint probe check (SPEC-livery-paint criterion 2): the probe livery on the stock
# Scion FR-S (1548) in the Autoshow showroom, from every side.
# Seed: a render seed of the .local/preview save (it spawns at Dak's Garage with enough credits),
# with `tools/paint-fh1-livery.py probe --stock-media SCI_FRS_13 --output <seed>`,
# `tools/build-mod-archives.py <seed>` and enabled_mods "zz-archive-patches,livery-probe" in the
# seed's config/pinyon_shift.toml. With a mod on the title first copies the profile into
# user-modded, so the menu shows later and A is pressed again at frames 1000-1300.
# Route: pause, MAP, the cursor nudged onto the Autoshow, Y fast travel, A; X enters the Autoshow;
# right 48 times to Scion (the carousel order with the 16 EU packages installed), A; right
# 0 times to the car, A: the showroom. The right stick then orbits the camera (41 captures)
# and a raised camera adds the rear (13 captures). Each panel shows its colour, each quadrant its
# patch: front-top white, rear-top black, front-bottom magenta, rear-bottom cyan.
